# Zatoona Release Signing Configuration
# =======================================
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE. Copy it to `keystore.properties` (same directory)
# and fill in your actual signing credentials.
#
# SECURITY: The real `keystore.properties` file is excluded from Git via
# .gitignore. NEVER commit your actual keystore, passwords, or signing
# credentials to version control.
#
# Steps to create your release keystore:
# 1. Generate a keystore using Android Studio or keytool:
#    keytool -genkeypair -v -keystore zatoona-release.keystore \
#            -alias zatoona -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
# 2. Copy this file to `keystore.properties` and fill in the values below.
# 3. Place your .keystore file in a secure location referenced by storeFile.
# 4. Build a signed release APK:
#    ./gradlew assembleRelease
#
# Required properties:
storeFile=../zatoona-release.keystore
storePassword=YOUR_STORE_PASSWORD_HERE
keyAlias=zatoona
keyPassword=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD_HERE
